    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d682">

                <pb facs="0663" n="1397" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1397"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr. Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-12-16"><hi rendition="#italic">December 16,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Dwight now says all missionaries in the interior will be sacrificed unless
                    united Christian powers intervene to stop massacre. I have no hope of European
                    concert. Mr. Dwight has written missionary boards. Tell them I can get vessels
                    to take their friends to Christian ports. If <pb facs="0664" n="1398"
                        xml:id="pg1398"/> men wish to remain, I will get escort for all to seacoast,
                    and men can return; but women and children should visit America. Observe, I gave
                    no advice, but state facts.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
